{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["The Daily Life of the Immortal King Season 2","Wang Ling has been living a quiet life ever since resolving a particular incident, but thanks to his previous tampering with the laws of nature, the level of psionic powers in the world has dropped drastically. To stop the levels from plummeting further, his spirit sword Jingke comes to the rescue. But due to the excessive use of power, Jingke ends up ripping a crack in space. This crack allows demons to infiltrate the world and steal spiritual energy essential to powering human society. Now the only person who has the power to thwart their plans is none other than Wang Ling.\n\n\n\nIn an attempt to balance his high school life with his supernatural one, Wang Ling must confront challenges ranging from teacher home visits, crafting spiritual swords, grappling with his growing feelings for Sun Rong, and battling invading demons!"],"ja":["仙王的日常生活 第二季",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":41094,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":50404,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-44069","ids":{"shikimori":44069,"mal":44069,"anilist":126357,"kodik":"serial-39512"},"kodikIds":["serial-38605","serial-39001","serial-39512"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-38605":"2022-01-08T13:43:57Z","serial-39001":"2022-01-12T15:33:02Z","serial-39512":"2022-01-29T15:02:24Z"},"title":"Повседневная жизнь бессмертного короля 2","originalTitle":"The Daily Life of the Immortal King 2","alt":"Рутина короля небожителей 2 / Повседневная жизнь бессмертного короля 2 / Повседневная жизнь сказочного короля 2 / Xian Wang de Richang Shenghuo 2 / Xian Wang De Ri Chang Sheng Huo 2 The Daily Life of the Immortal King Season 2 仙王的日常生活 第二季","description":"Это продолжение истории о сильнейшем заклинателе всего мира Ван Лине . Вокруг главного героя всегда что-то происходит: то демоны нападают из-за каждого угла, то у друзей возникают какие-то проблемы. Сможет ли Ван Лин справиться со всеми трудностями и случайно не разрушить вселенную и